+
+// Sampling profiler (config SampleHz, 0 = off). Each thread's own CPU time drives a SIGPROF timer (unix side); a
+// FEX-internal thread drains the samples, maps them to guest module+offset (and export, where one is near) and
+// once a minute appends the busiest thread's top 200 and the rest's top 50 to /dev/shm/fex-<pid>-samples.csv.
